em "Given that\n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}],$\nfind $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi D}{6}).$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi D}{6})=\\,\\,$ |  | $0$ | {{field-4}} | {{field-5}} |  |\n|  |  | $0$ | $0$ | {{field-6}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "Given a function $f$ and a diagonal matrix $D$ with diagonal entries ${\\lambda }_{1},…,{\\lambda }_{n},$ we have\n\n$$\nf(D)=[\\begin{aligned}f({\\lambda }_{1}) & ⋯ & 0 \\\\ ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ 0 & ⋯ & f({\\lambda }_{n})\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi D}{6}) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{6}) & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{6}) & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{6})\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-253241/field-1" "q-253241/field-2" "q-253241/field-3" "q-253241/field-4" "q-253241/field-5" "q-253241/field-6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "343f8efc-fdef-51dc-ad3f-fad1ab37bc88"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-253241"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-252924/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "3baa2559-f4af-5afc-a6b7-0cfb547738d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-252924/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "c901ce86-aca7-5da4-80fb-72daa125d270" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186154656 :answer-field/correct "q-252924/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-f